@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Linux s390x system bindings
+
+Big-endian ELF64, EM_S390 (22). Landlock is static musl; flock has separate glibc/musl Node-API v8 addons. The glibc process addon supplies execve and fcntl to the Linux subprocess bootstrap.
